@startuml 01-stride
left to right direction

rectangle "Operator workstation\n(trust boundary 1: local user)" as WS {
  actor "Operator" as OP
  rectangle "CLI agent" as AG
  rectangle "Local tools\n(shell, git, bd)" as TL
}

rectangle "Untrusted repository content\n(trust boundary 2: issue, PR and doc text)" as REPO #FFE5E5
cloud "External LLM API\n(trust boundary 3)" as API
cloud "GitHub\n(trust boundary 4)" as GH

OP --> AG : instructions (trusted)
AG --> TL : run commands
REPO --> AG : read as data only
AG --> API : prompts and context
AG --> GH : issue and PR calls
@enduml
